\"><div class=\"container-page flex items-center justify-between py-2\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\"><a href=\"tel:+977015361104\" class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-white/85 hover:text-secondary-500 transition-colors\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-phone h-3.5 w-3.5\"><path d=\"M22 16.92v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.18 2 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-8.63-3.07 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-3.07-8.67A2 2 0 0 1 4.11 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.72 12.84 12.84 0 0 0 .7 2.81 2 2 0 0 1-.45 2.11L8.09 9.91a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.27-1.27a2 2 0 0 1 2.11-.45 12.84 12.84 0 0 0 2.81.7A2 2 0 0 1 22 16.92z\"></path></svg> +977-01-5361104</a><a href=\"mailto:info@reliancenepal.com.np\" class=\"hidden items-center gap-1.5 text-white/85 hover:text-secondary-500 transition-colors md:flex\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-mail h-3.5 w-3.5\"><rect width=\"20\" height=\"16\" x=\"2\" y=\"4\" rx=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"m22 7-8.97 5.7a1.94 1.94 0 0 1-2.06 0L2 7\"></path></svg> info@reliancenepal.com.np</a><a class=\"hidden items-center gap-1.5 font-semibold text-secondary-500 hover:text-secondary-400 transition-colors md:flex\" href=\"/loan-enquiry\">Loan Enquiry</a></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\"><a class=\"text-white/85 hover:text-secondary-500 transition-colors\" href=\"/contact\">Grievance</a><div class=\"h-4 w-px bg-white/20\"></div><a href=\"/np\" class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm font-medium transition-opacity hover:opacity-80\"><span class=\"inline-block h-4 w-6 overflow-hidden rounded\"><img src=\"https://reliancenepal.com.np/assets/images/reliance/en_flag.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"h-full w-full object-cover\"/></span>English</a><button class=\"transition-opacity hover:opacity-80\" aria-label=\"खोजी गर्नुहोस्\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-search h-5 w-5\"><circle cx=\"11\" cy=\"11\" r=\"8\"></circle><path d=\"m21 21-4.3-4.3\"></path></svg></button></div></div></div><div class=\"sticky top-0 z-50 transition-all duration-300 bg-white/85 backdrop-blur-md\"><div class=\"container-page flex h-20 items-center justify-between\"><a class=\"flex-shrink-0\" href=\"/\"><img src=\"https://reliancenepal.com.np/assets/images/reliance/logo.png\" alt=\"Reliance Finance\" class=\"h-12 w-auto\"/></a><nav class=\"hidden items-center gap-1 lg:flex\"><div class=\"group relative\"><a class=\"flex items-center gap-1 rounded-md px-3 py-2.5 font-heading text-sm font-medium transition-colors text-text-primary hover:bg-primary-50 hover:text-primary-500\" href=\"/about\">हाम्रो बारे<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down h-3.5 w-3.5\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></a></div><div class=\"group relative\"><a class=\"flex items-center gap-1 rounded-md px-3 py-2.5 font-heading text-sm font-medium transition-colors text-text-primary hover:bg-primary-50 hover:text-primary-500\" href=\"/products/savings\">बचत<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down h-3.5 w-3.5\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></a></div><div class=\"group relative\"><a class=\"flex items-center gap-1 rounded-md px-3 py-2.5 font-heading text-sm font-medium transition-colors text-text-primary hover:bg-primary-50 hover:text-primary-500\" href=\"/products/fixed-deposits\">मुद्दती निक्षेप<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down h-3.5 w-3.5\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></a></div><div class=\"group relative\"><a class=\"flex items-center gap-1 rounded-md px-3 py-2.5 font-heading text-sm font-medium transition-colors text-text-primary hover:bg-primary-50 hover:text-primary-500\" href=\"/products/loans\">ऋण<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down h-3.5 w-3.5\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></a></div><div class=\"group relative\"><a class=\"flex items-center gap-1 rounded-md px-3 py-2.5 font-heading text-sm font-medium transition-colors text-text-primary hover:bg-primary-50 hover:text-primary-500\" href=\"/services\">सेवाहरू<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down h-3.5 w-3.5\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></a></div><div class=\"group relative\"><a class=\"flex items-center gap-1 rounded-md px-3 py-2.5 font-heading text-sm font-medium transition-colors text-text-primary hover:bg-primary-50 hover:text-primary-500\" href=\"/rates\">ब्याज दर<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down h-3.5 w-3.5\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></a></div><div class=\"group relative\"><a class=\"flex items-center gap-1 rounded-md px-3 py-2.5 font-heading text-sm font-medium transition-colors text-text-primary hover:bg-primary-50 hover:text-primary-500\" href=\"/publications\">प्रकाशनहरू<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down h-3.5 w-3.5\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></a></div><div class=\"group relative\"><a class=\"flex items-center gap-1 rounded-md px-3 py-2.5 font-heading text-sm font-medium transition-colors text-text-primary hover:bg-primary-50 hover:text-primary-500\" href=\"/contact\">सम्पर्क</a></div></nav><button class=\"flex flex-col gap-1.5 lg:hidden\" aria-label=\"Menu\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-menu h-6 w-6\"><line x1=\"4\" x2=\"20\" y1=\"12\" y2=\"12\"></line><line x1=\"4\" x2=\"20\" y1=\"6\" y2=\"6\"></line><line x1=\"4\" x2=\"20\" y1=\"18\" y2=\"18\"></line></svg></button></div></div></header><main class=\"flex-1\"><section class=\"hero-slider relative h-[70vh] min-h-[500px] max-h-[800px] overflow-hidden bg-black\"><div class=\"slide absolute inset-0 bg-cover bg-center transition-opacity duration-1000 flex items-center opacity-100 z-10\" style=\"background-image:url(https://rfil-api.sudeepdhakal.workers.dev/api/media/214dd0a0bdac9c93312f3f57d3e0f9f3de0504b2.jpg)\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-r from-black/75 via-black/40 to-transparent z-[2]\"></div><div class=\"container-page relative z-[3] w-full transition-all duration-1000 translate-y-0\"><div class=\"max-w-[650px] text-white\"><h2 class=\"mb-4 text-[clamp(2.5rem,6vw,4rem)] font-extrabold leading-tight text-secondary-500\">आरएफएल स्मार्ट बैंकिङको साथ डिजिटल बन्नुहोस्</h2><p class=\"mb-8 text-[clamp(1rem,2vw,1.25rem)] text-white/90\">नेपालमा जुनसुकै समय र जुनसुकै ठाउँमा सहज मोबाइल बैंकिङ, क्यूआर भुक्तानी र डिजिटल स्थानान्तरणको अनुभव लिनुहोस्।</p><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-4\"><a class=\"btn btn-secondary\" href=\"/products/savings\">Open Account</a><a class=\"btn btn-outline !border-white !text-white hover:!bg-white/10\" href=\"/rates\">View Rates</a></div></div></div></div><div class=\"slide absolute inset-0 bg-cover bg-center transition-opacity duration-1000 flex items-center opacity-0 z-0\" style=\"background-image:url(https://rfil-api.sudeepdhakal.workers.dev/api/media/d6515bd5f4c1b099740dde56a7faa2ec3c852757.jpg)\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-r from-black/75 via-black/40 to-transparent z-[2]\"></div><div class=\"container-page relative z-[3] w-full transition-all duration-1000 translate-y-8\"><div class=\"max-w-[650px] text-white\"><h2 class=\"mb-4 text-[clamp(2.5rem,6vw,4rem)] font-extrabold leading-tight text-secondary-500\">व्यक्तिगत मुद्दती निक्षेप</h2><p class=\"mb-8 text-[clamp(1rem,2vw,1.25rem)] text-white/90\">आफ्नो कडा परिश्रमको बचतमा उच्च प्रतिफल कमाउनुहोस्। लचिलो अवधि र आकर्षक ब्याजदरको साथ मुद्दती निक्षेप खोल्नुहोस्।</p><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-4\"><a class=\"btn btn-secondary\" href=\"/products/fixed-deposits\">Learn More</a><a class=\"btn btn-outline !border-white !text-white hover:!bg-white/10\" href=\"/products/fixed-deposits#calculator\">Calculate Earnings</a></div></div></div></div><div class=\"slide absolute inset-0 bg-cover bg-center transition-opacity duration-1000 flex items-center opacity-0 z-0\" style=\"background-image:url(https://rfil-api.sudeepdhakal.workers.dev/api/media/214dd0a0bdac9c93312f3f57d3e0f9f3de0504b2.jpg)\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-r from-black/75 via-black/40 to-transparent z-[2]\"></div><div class=\"container-page relative z-[3] w-full transition-all duration-1000 translate-y-8\"><div class=\"max-w-[650px] text-white\"><h2 class=\"mb-4 text-[clamp(2.5rem,6vw,4rem)] font-extrabold leading-tight text-secondary-500\">लचिलो गृह र अटो ऋण</h2><p class=\"mb-8 text-[clamp(1rem,2vw,1.25rem)] text-white/90\">तपाईंको लागि अनुकूल कम ब्याजदरको गृह, सवारी र कृषि ऋण विकल्पहरूको साथ आफ्नो सपनालाई वास्तविकतामा परिणत गर्नुहोस्।</p><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-4\"><a class=\"btn btn-secondary\" href=\"/products/loans\">Explore Loans</a><a class=\"btn btn-outline !border-white !text-white hover:!bg-white/10\" href=\"/emi\">EMI Calculator</a></div></div></div></div><div class=\"slide absolute inset-0 bg-cover bg-center transition-opacity duration-1000 flex items-center opacity-0 z-0\" style=\"background-image:url(https://rfil-api.sudeepdhakal.workers.dev/api/media/d6515bd5f4c1b099740dde56a7faa2ec3c852757.jpg)\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-r from-black/75 via-black/40 to-transparent z-[2]\"></div><div class=\"container-page relative z-[3] w-full transition-all duration-1000 translate-y-8\"><div class=\"max-w-[650px] text-white\"><h2 class=\"mb-4 text-[clamp(2.5rem,6vw,4rem)] font-extrabold leading-tight text-secondary-500\">कर्पोरेट प्रशासन र विरासत</h2><p class=\"mb-8 text-[clamp(1rem,2vw,1.25rem)] text-white/90\">पारदर्शिता, संस्थागत अखण्डता र नेपाल राष्ट्र बैंकको नियमनको पालनाद्वारा एक दशकभन्दा बढी समयदेखि मार्गनिर्देशित।</p><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-4\"><a class=\"btn btn-secondary\" href=\"/governance\">Governance Policies</a><a class=\"btn btn-outline !border-white !text-white hover:!bg-white/10\" href=\"/about#bod\">Board of Directors</a></div></div></div></div><div class=\"slide absolute inset-0 bg-cover bg-center transition-opacity duration-1000 flex items-center opacity-0 z-0\" style=\"background-image:url(https://rfil-api.sudeepdhakal.workers.dev/api/media/214dd0a0bdac9c93312f3f57d3e0f9f3de0504b2.jpg)\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-r from-black/75 via-black/40 to-transparent z-[2]\"></div><div class=\"container-page relative z-[3] w-full transition-all duration-1000 translate-y-8\"><div class=\"max-w-[650px] text-white\"><h2 class=\"mb-4 text-[clamp(2.5rem,6vw,4rem)] font-extrabold leading-tight text-secondary-500\">द्रुत र सुरक्षित रेमिट्यान्स</h2><p class=\"mb-8 text-[clamp(1rem,2vw,1.25rem)] text-white/90\">हाम्रो देशभरको शाखा सञ्जाल मार्फत सजिलै अन्तर्राष्ट्रिय र आन्तरिक रकम स्थानान्तरण प्राप्त गर्नुहोस्।</p><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-4\"><a class=\"btn btn-secondary\" href=\"/services#remittance\">Explore Remittance</a><a class=\"btn btn-outline !border-white !text-white hover:!bg-white/10\" href=\"/branches\">Locate Branches</a></div></div></div></div><div class=\"slider-controls absolute bottom-8 right-8 z-[4] flex gap-3\"><button class=\"slider-btn flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-white/20 text-white backdrop-blur transition-colors hover:bg-secondary-500 hover:text-text-primary\" aria-label=\"Previous\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-left h-5 w-5\"><path d=\"m15 18-6-6 6-6\"></path></svg></button><button class=\"slider-btn flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-white/20 text-white backdrop-blur transition-colors hover:bg-secondary-500 hover:text-text-primary\" aria-label=\"Next\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-right h-5 w-5\"><path d=\"m9 18 6-6-6-6\"></path></svg></button></div><div class=\"absolute bottom-8 left-1/2 z-[4] flex -translate-x-1/2 gap-3\"><button class=\"h-3 rounded-full transition-all w-8 bg-secondary-500\" aria-label=\"Go to slide 1\"></button><button class=\"h-3 rounded-full transition-all w-3 bg-white/50 hover:bg-white/80\" aria-label=\"Go to slide 2\"></button><button class=\"h-3 rounded-full transition-all w-3 bg-white/50 hover:bg-white/80\" aria-label=\"Go to slide 3\"></button><button class=\"h-3 rounded-full transition-all w-3 bg-white/50 hover:bg-white/80\" aria-label=\"Go to slide 4\"></button><button class=\"h-3 rounded-full transition-all w-3 bg-white/50 hover:bg-white/80\" aria-label=\"Go to slide 5\"></button></div></section><section class=\"section bg-white\"><div class=\"container-page\"><div class=\"section-header\"><h2>हाम्रा मुख्य सेवाहरू</h2><p>तपाईंको भविष्य निर्माण गर्न र पारस्परिक वृद्धिलाई बढावा दिन डिजाइन गरिएका हाम्रा अनुकूलित वित्तीय उत्पादनहरूको विस्तृत श्रृंखला अन्वेषण गर्नुहोस्।</p></div><div class=\"service-grid grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4\"><div class=\"service-card group relative flex flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-gray-100 bg-white p-8 transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-primary-500 hover:shadow-lg\"><div class=\"service-card-icon-wrapper mb-5 flex h-[60px] w-[60px] items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-primary-50 transition-all duration-300 group-hover:bg-secondary-500\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-wallet h-7 w-7 text-primary-500 transition-all duration-300 group-hover:text-white\"><path d=\"M19 7V4a1 1 0 0 0-1-1H5a2 2 0 0 0 0 4h15a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v4h-3a2 2 0 0 0 0 4h3a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-2a1 1 0 0 0-1-1\"></path><path d=\"M3 5v14a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h15a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-4\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"mb-3 font-heading text-xl font-extrabold text-primary-500 flex items-center justify-between\">निक्षेप र बचत<span class=\"service-card-counter ml-2 rounded-full bg-gray-100 px-2 py-0.5 text-[0.75rem] font-bold text-gray-500\">१४+ विकल्प</span></h3><p class=\"mb-5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-gray-500\">सबैको लागि तयार पारिएको बचत खाता