erest home, vehicle, and agricultural loan options customized for you.\\\",\\\"descriptionNp\\\":\\\"तपाईंको लागि अनुकूल कम ब्याजदरको गृह, सवारी र कृषि ऋण विकल्पहरूको साथ आफ्नो सपनालाई वास्तविकतामा परिणत गर्नुहोस्।\\\",\\\"imageUrl\\\":\\\"https://rfil-api.sudeepdhakal.workers.dev/api/media/214dd0a0bdac9c93312f3f57d3e0f9f3de0504b2.jpg\\\",\\\"ctaPrimaryText\\\":\\\"Explore Loans\\\",\\\"ctaPrimaryLink\\\":\\\"/products/loans\\\",\\\"ctaSecondaryText\\\":\\\"EMI Calculator\\\",\\\"ctaSecondaryLink\\\":\\\"/emi\\\",\\\"sortOrder\\\":3,\\\"isActive\\\":true,\\\"createdAt\\\":\\\"2026-07-28 18:57:14\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":4,\\\"title\\\":\\\"Corporate Governance \\u0026 Legacy\\\",\\\"titleNp\\\":\\\"कर्पोरेट प्रशासन र विरासत\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Guided by transparency, institutional integrity, and compliance under Nepal Rastra Bank regulations for over a decade.\\\",\\\"descriptionNp\\\":\\\"पारदर्शिता, संस्थागत अखण्डता र नेपाल राष्ट्र बैंकको नियमनको पालनाद्वारा एक दशकभन्दा बढी समयदेखि मार्गनिर्देशित।\\\",\\\"imageUrl\\\":\\\"https://rfil-api.sudeepdhakal.workers.dev/api/media/d6515bd5f4c1b099740dde56a7faa2ec3c852757.jpg\\\",\\\"ctaPrimaryText\\\":\\\"Governance Policies\\\",\\\"ctaPrimaryLink\\\":\\\"/governance\\\",\\\"ctaSecondaryText\\\":\\\"Board of Directors\\\",\\\"ctaSecondaryLink\\\":\\\"/about#bod\\\",\\\"sortOrder\\\":4,\\\"isActive\\\":true,\\\"createdAt\\\":\\\"2026-07-28 18:57:14\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":5,\\\"title\\\":\\\"Fast \\u0026 Secure Remittance\\\",\\\"titleNp\\\":\\\"द्रुत र सुरक्षित रेमिट्यान्स\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Collect international and domestic money transfers easily across our nationwide branch network.\\\",\\\"descriptionNp\\\":\\\"हाम्रो देशभरको शाखा सञ्जाल मार्फत सजिलै अन्तर्राष्ट्रिय र आन्तरिक रकम स्थानान्तरण प्राप्त गर्नुहोस्।\\\",\\\"imageUrl\\\":\\\"https://rfil-api.sudeepdhakal.workers.dev/api/media/214dd0a0bdac9c93312f3f57d3e0f9f3de0504b2.jpg\\\",\\\"ctaPrimaryText\\\":\\\"Explore Remittance\\\",\\\"ctaPrimaryLink\\\":\\\"/servi