c9c93312f3f57d3e0f9f3de0504b2.jpg\",\"ctaPrimaryText\":\"Open Account\",\"ctaPrimaryLink\":\"/products/savings\",\"ctaSecondaryText\":\"View Rates\",\"ctaSecondaryLink\":\"/rates\",\"sortOrder\":1,\"isActive\":true,\"createdAt\":\"2026-07-28 18:57:14\"},{\"id\":2,\"title\":\"Individual Fixed Deposits\",\"titleNp\":\"व्यक्तिगत मुद्दती निक्षेप\",\"description\":\"Earn higher returns on your hard-earned savings. Open a fixed deposit with flexible tenures and lucrative rates.\",\"descriptionNp\":\"आफ्नो कडा परिश्रमको बचतमा उच्च प्रतिफल कमाउनुहोस्। लचिलो अवधि र आकर्षक ब्याजदरको साथ मुद्दती निक्षेप खोल्नुहोस्।\",\"imageUrl\":\"https://rfil-api.sudeepdhakal.workers.dev/api/media/d6515bd5f4c1b099740dde56a7faa2ec3c852757.jpg\",\"ctaPrimaryText\":\"Learn More\",\"ctaPrimaryLink\":\"/products/fixed-deposits\",\"ctaSecondaryText\":\"Calculate Earnings\",\"ctaSecondaryLink\":\"/products/fixed-deposits#calculator\",\"sortOrder\":2,\"isActive\":true,\"createdAt\":\"2026-07-28 18:57:14\"},{\"id\":3,\"title\":\"Flexible Home & Auto Loans\",\"titleNp\":\"लचिलो गृह र अटो ऋण\",\"description\":\"Turn your dreams into reality with low-interest home, vehicle, and agricultural loan options customized for you.\",\"descriptionNp\":\"तपाईंको लागि अनुकूल कम ब्याजदरको गृह, सवारी र कृषि ऋण विकल्पहरूको साथ आफ्नो सपनालाई वास्तविकतामा परिणत गर्नुहोस्।\",\"imageUrl\":\"https://rfil-api.sudeepdhakal.workers.dev/api/media/214dd0a0bdac9c93312f3f57d3e0f9f3de0504b2.jpg\",\"ctaPrimaryText\":\"Explore Loans\",\"ctaPrimaryLink\":\"/products/loans\",\"ctaSecondaryText\":\"EMI Calculator\",\"ctaSecondaryLink\":\"/emi\",\"sortOrder\":3,\"isActive\":true,\"createdAt\":\"2026-07-28 18:57:14\"},{\"id\":4,\"title\":\"Corporate Governance & Legacy\",\"titleNp\":\"कर्पोरेट प्रशासन र विरासत\",\"description\":\"Guided by transparency, institutional integrity, and compliance under Nepal Rastra Bank regulations for over a decade.\",\"descriptionNp\":\"पारदर्शिता, संस्थागत अखण्डता र नेपाल राष्ट्र बैंकको नियमनको पालनाद्वारा एक दशकभन्दा बढी समयदेखि मार्गनिर्देशित।\",\"imageUrl\":\"https://rfil-api.sudeepdhakal.workers.dev/api/media/d6515bd5f4c1b099740dde56a7faa2ec3c852757.jpg\",\"ctaPrimaryText\":\"Governance Policies\",\"ctaPrimaryLink\":\"/governance\",\"ctaSecondaryText\":\"Board of Directors\",\"ctaSecondaryLink\":\"/about#bod\",\"sortOrder\":4,\"isActive\":true,\"createdAt\":\"2026-07-28 18:57:14\"},{\"id\":5,\"title\":\"Fast & Secure Remittance\",\"titleNp\":\"द्रुत र सुरक्षित रेमिट्यान्स\",\"description\":\"Collect international and domestic money transfers easily across our nationwide branch network.\",\"descriptionNp\":\"हाम्रो देशभरको शाखा सञ्जाल मार्फत सजिलै अन्तर्राष्ट्रिय र आन्तरिक रकम स्थानान्तरण प्राप्त गर्नुहोस्।\",\"imageUrl\":\"https://rfil-api.sudeepdhakal.workers.dev/api/media/214dd0a0bdac9c93312f3f57d3e0f9f3de0504b2.jpg\",\"ctaPrimaryText\":\"Explore Remittance\",\"ctaPrimaryLink\":\"/services#remittance\",\"ctaSecondaryText\":\"Locate Branches\",\"ctaSecondaryLink\":\"/branches\",\"sortOrder\":5,\"isActive\":true,\"createdAt\":\"2026-07-28 18:57:14\"}],\"lang\":\"np\"}],[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"className\":\"section bg-white\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"container-page\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"section-header\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"children\":\"हाम्रा मुख्य सेवाहरू\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"तपाईंको भविष्य निर्माण गर्न र पारस्परिक वृद्धिलाई बढावा दिन डिजाइन गरिएका हाम्रा अनुकूलित वित्तीय उत्पादनहरूको विस्तृत श्रृंखला अन्वेषण गर्नुहोस्।\"}]]}],\"$L16\"]}]}],\"$L17\",\"$L18\",\"$L19\",\"$L1a\",\"$L1b\"]\n1c:I[11948,[\"2619\",\"static/chunks/2619-3773513dd40498bb.js\",\"8728\",\"static/chunks/8728-9c7fe26bd0893d61.js\",\"911\",\"static/chunks/app/%5Blang%5D/page-42e61ff5e5b3678f.js\"],\"default\"]\n1d:I[52619,[\"2619\",\"static/chunks/2619-3773513dd40498bb.js\",\"8728\",\"static/chunks/8728-9c7fe26bd0893d61.js\",\"911\",\"static/chunks/app/%5Blang%5D/page-42e61ff5e5b3678f.js\"],\"\"]\n1e:I