वितरण र राहत सामग्री प्रदान गर्दै।\",\"imageUrl\":\"https://reliancenepal.com.np/uploads/news/thumb/cb63cb6bdd9316027c801d2ae88a24bd8fc098a4.jpg\",\"date\":\"2021-06-09\",\"linkUrl\":\"/csr?id=kohalpur-food\",\"sortOrder\":1,\"isActive\":true,\"createdAt\":\"2026-07-28 18:57:14\"},{\"id\":2,\"title\":\"Free Eye Check-Up & Cataract Surgery Camp\",\"titleNp\":\"निःशुल्क आँखा जाँच र मोतियाबिन्दु शल्यक्रिया शिविर\",\"summary\":\"In association with Lions Club International, RFL organized an eye health camp in Lalitpur, restoring vision for 43 senior citizens.\",\"summaryNp\":\"लायन्स क्लब इन्टरनेसनलको सहकार्यमा, आरएफएलले ललितपुरमा आँखा स्वास्थ्य शिविर आयोजना गरी ४३ जना ज्येष्ठ नागरिकको दृष्टि पुनर्स्थापना गर्यो।\",\"imageUrl\":\"https://reliancenepal.com.np/uploads/news/thumb/9e6d1ff2a714b9d6b07a9ef4fb29d7f35272a292.jpg\",\"date\":\"2021-03-13\",\"linkUrl\":\"/csr?id=eye-camp-lalitpur\",\"sortOrder\":2,\"isActive\":true,\"createdAt\":\"2026-07-28 18:57:14\"},{\"id\":3,\"title\":\"Primary School Bag Handover Drive Solukhumbu\",\"titleNp\":\"सोलुखुम्बु प्राथमिक विद्यालय झोला हस्तान्तरण अभियान\",\"summary\":\"Distributing study materials and school bags to children in Solukhumbu district, encouraging primary education access.\",\"summaryNp\":\"सोलुखुम्बु जिल्लाका बालबालिकालाई अध्ययन सामग्री र स्कुल झोला वितरण गर्दै प्रारम्भिक शिक्षामा पहुँच प्रोत्साहन गर्ने।\",\"imageUrl\":\"https://reliancenepal.com.np/uploads/news/thumb/7e85ee09a12d83b4ca49924b6db4b8a76ec2c5da.jpg\",\"date\":\"2019-10-15\",\"linkUrl\":\"/csr?id=school-bag-solukhumbu\",\"sortOrder\":3,\"isActive\":true,\"createdAt\":\"2026-07-28 18:57:14\"}],\"lang\":\"np\"}]]}]}]\n1b:[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"className\":\"section bg-surface-alt\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"container-page\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"digital-banking-banner relative overflow-hidden rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-primary-500 to-[#3e0c4e] px-10 py-12 text-white\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\"